{"id":"vod_sn_37468","vodId":"37468","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"祝福的钟声","name_cn":"祝福的钟声","date":"2010-01-01","year":"2010","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/82752d0d3a8bed4ff44b7618a33da09f.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在名为“艾尔塔利亚”的都市之中，在那里，汇聚着来自世界各地价值连城的宝藏。收获祭即将拉开序幕，这盛大的庆典吸引了各地商人、游客前来参加，整个城市陷入了一片欢乐而躁动的海洋之中，据传说，祭奠当满，将出现流星缀满天空的壮观景象。　　雷斯塔（冈本信彦 配音）是隶属于Oasis冒险团的道具师，某日，他受到了青梅竹马的好友卡丽娜（古山贵实子 配音）的邀请，来到了尚在建设之中的祭奠街道，在这里，两人偶遇了名为阿妮艾斯（水桥香织 配音）的街头艺人和名为切露西（今井麻美 配音）的神殿骑士，阿妮艾斯自称是排行世界第一的人偶师，而切露西则替盛典担任着警卫的职责。几人并不知道的是，当晚的流星将会彻底改变他们的命运。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:52:44","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/MNXkJEDF981/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/L66ahmwxHJ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/aFiBp7EQyg1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/rq4SRW2Lux1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/kYCy5pyPYw1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/xRJGKQsV1G1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/xWUrjSzgqz1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/qVPxXcme2T1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/aa33iHDiiJ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/U1cH1ysVnV1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/n0Y3WqQaGr1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/gCfVW6fLQ31/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:10.224Z"}